    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Joe,<div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Thank you very much for the material and code.  I hope your code is the translation of the mplus code in <a href=\"https://www.statmodel.com/download/Preacher.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.statmodel.com/download/Preacher.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422859258000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1SrV9xAQqPk0hk8BuRtvbU\">https://www.statmodel.com/download/Preacher.pdf</a>  code I. (1-1-1 model with fixed slopes (MSEM)). Following you footstep I try to adapt the code for the random slope presnted in G. 1-1-1 model (traditional MLM) of <a href=\"https://www.statmodel.com/download/Preacher.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.statmodel.com/download/Preacher.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422859258000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1SrV9xAQqPk0hk8BuRtvbU\">https://www.statmodel.com/download/Preacher.pdf</a>. But when I run the lavaan code it gives me the following error message </div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lav_data_full</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cluster </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cluster</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  lavaan ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> missing observed variables </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dataset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aw bw sc</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>The code is below </div><div><br></div><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div></div></code></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
