:#000\">lavaan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div></code></div></blockquote></div></div>"
