    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>You are welcome.  Sorry about the duplicate posts.  Sent via email but they didn&#39;t show up quickly so I copied and pasted into the GG page.<div><br></div><div>But yes, MSEM 1-1-1.  And aw, bw are labels, not variables.  It&#39;s really important to go through the lavaan tutorial for all of the features.  After that I suggest recreating some of the Mplus analyses in lavaan--gives you something to aim for.  </div></div><div><br></div><div>Joe</div><div> </div></div>"
